# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SignBridge 3D — environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The core demo runs 100% locally with NO environment variables configured.
# Every variable below is OPTIONAL and only enables optional cloud features.

# Supabase (optional) — enables cloud sync of progress across devices.
# Find these in: Supabase Dashboard -> Project Settings -> API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# NOTE:
# - Only the ANON key may be exposed to the browser.
# - NEVER commit the service_role key or put it in any VITE_ variable.
